---
title: Ways to Give
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /give/
wide: true
eyebrow: Give
hero_heading: Ways to give
hero_accent: give
hero_subtext: Every gift made today goes toward the lease or purchase of our first transitional home in Denton County.
hero_note: every gift draws a line
hero_donate: give-hero
hero_image: /assets/images/photos/giving-day.webp
hero_w: 1536
hero_h: 1024
hero_alt: House keys, a small notebook and a folded blanket on a sunlit table.
hero_pos: 40% 50%
meta_description: Support Oasis Women Center. Give financially, donate a vehicle or gift cards, volunteer your skills, or refer a woman who needs housing.
---
{% from "partials/plan-sketch.njk" import sketch %}

<section class="split" aria-labelledby="money-h">
  <div class="col col-ink" data-rv>
    <p class="eyebrow">Give financially</p>
    <h2 class="stmt" id="money-h">The house is the <em>whole ask</em>.</h2>
    <p class="lede-xl">Until that door opens, no woman moves in. That is the entire campaign, stated plainly.</p>
    {% if site.donation_url %}
    <div class="actions actions-tight">
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="{{ site.donation_url }}?utm_source=site&amp;utm_medium=give-ask&amp;utm_campaign=the-plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Give now
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="actions actions-tight">
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=I%20would%20like%20to%20donate">
        Email us to give
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:20px;">Online giving is being set up now. Email us in the meantime and we will send you everything you need.</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:24px;">Oasis Women Center was founded by Keisha Ortiz, our Founder and Board Chair. <a href="/founder/">Read her story.</a></p>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:8px;">A registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit, EIN {{ site.ein }}. Contributions are tax deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col col-photo" data-open>
    <img src="/assets/images/photos/house-exterior-wide.webp" alt="A single-story brick home with a covered porch, a green lawn, a driveway, and a live oak in the afternoon sun." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="--pos:48% 50%">
  </div>
</section>

{# These drawings carry the page's paper color in the file, so this band must stay on --paper. #}
<section class="bd bd-paper" aria-labelledby="lines-h">
  <div class="bd-in">
    <div class="sec-center" data-rv>
      <p class="eyebrow">Fund a line</p>
      <h2 class="title" id="lines-h">Every gift draws one of these in.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Every line of the house has a price.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="strip" data-rv style="--d:.1s">
      {#- Each one opens that line's own Zeffy form when plan.json has a zeffy_url for it, otherwise the main form. #}
      {%- for ln in plan.lines %}
      <li{% if ln.funded %} class="is-funded"{% endif %}>
        <a href="{{ ln.zeffy_url or site.donation_url }}?utm_source=site&amp;utm_medium=give-line&amp;utm_campaign=the-plan&amp;utm_content={{ ln.id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="strip-pic">{{ sketch(ln, true) }}</span>
          <span class="hand">{{ ln.words }}</span>
          <span class="strip-t">{{ ln.title }}</span>
          <span class="strip-amt">{% if ln.funded %}Funded. Thank you.{% else %}{{ ln.price }}{% endif %}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-ink" href="/#fund">See every line</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bd bd-sand" aria-labelledby="inkind-h">
  <div class="bd-in">
    <div class="sec-center" data-rv>
      <p class="eyebrow">Give without writing a check</p>
      <h2 class="title" id="inkind-h">Not everything we need <em>is money</em>.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Several of the gaps in our program are filled better by things and time than by dollars.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="idx">
      <li data-rv>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>Donate a vehicle</h3>
        <p>A reliable used car or 15 passenger van becomes transportation for women getting to work, court, treatment, and childcare. One vehicle serves many residents.</p>
      </li>
      <li data-rv>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>Gift cards for rides and gas</h3>
        <p>Uber and Lyft gift cards, gas cards, and prepaid transit passes go straight to a resident who needs to get where she needs to be.</p>
      </li>
      <li data-rv>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h3>Furnish a room</h3>
        <p>A bed, a dresser, linens, a lamp. When the house opens, all four bedrooms have to be ready on day one, not month three.</p>
      </li>
      <li data-rv>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <h3>Teach financial literacy</h3>
        <p>If you work in finance, accounting, banking, or coaching, we want you leading budgeting workshops. This is the volunteer role we are actively filling.</p>
      </li>
      <li data-rv>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        <h3>Donate professional services</h3>
        <p>Legal, accounting, counseling, trades, repairs. In-kind services are tracked and documented, and we provide a letter at year end.</p>
      </li>
      <li data-rv>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
        <h3>Become a monthly donor</h3>
        <p>Recurring gifts of any size are what will allow us to sign a lease or purchase with confidence. Predictable income is worth more to us than a one-time total.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="actions" data-rv>
      <a class="btn btn-ink" href="/contact/#form">
        Contact us
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
      {% if site.donation_url %}
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="{{ site.donation_url }}?utm_source=site&amp;utm_medium=give-inkind&amp;utm_campaign=the-plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Give now
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="split" aria-labelledby="refer-h">
  <div class="col col-paper ed" data-rv>
    <p class="eyebrow">Refer a woman</p>
    <h2 class="title" id="refer-h">Know someone <em>who needs this</em>?</h2>
    <p>If you work at a shelter, a treatment program, a hospital, a church, or an agency, and you are working with a woman who has completed recovery and has nowhere stable to go, tell us about her.</p>
    <p>We are building the referral pipeline now, so that no bed sits empty on the day the house opens.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-ink" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Referral">
        Send a referral
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col col-photo" data-open>
    <img src="/assets/images/photos/road-day.webp" alt="A quiet street of single-story brick homes under live oaks on a bright morning." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bd bd-pine cl" aria-labelledby="questions-h">
  <div class="bd-in" data-rv>
    <h2 class="stmt" id="questions-h">Questions before <em>you give</em>?</h2>
    <p class="lede-xl">Call {{ site.phone }} or email {{ site.email }}. A real person answers.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-glass" href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace('-', '') }}">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-glass" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if site.donation_url %}
{# The page ends on the ask. Gold on this page means one thing: Zeffy. #}
<section class="bd bd-sand cl" aria-labelledby="close-h">
  <div class="bd-in" data-rv>
    <p class="eyebrow">Open the door</p>
    <h2 class="stmt" id="close-h">Help us open <em>the door</em>.</h2>
    <p class="lede-xl">Every gift made today goes toward the lease or purchase of our first transitional home in Denton County.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="{{ site.donation_url }}?utm_source=site&amp;utm_medium=give-close&amp;utm_campaign=the-plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Give now
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:26px;">A registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit, EIN {{ site.ein }}. Contributions are tax deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
